---
import Layout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Container from '../components/containers/Container.astro'
import PageHeader from '../components/partials/PageHeader.astro'
import ProfileSection from '../components/partials/ProfileSection.astro'
import { aboutDescription, profileRole } from '../config/personal'
import portrait from '../assets/chris/portrait.jpg'
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description={aboutDescription}
  pubDateTime={new Date('1 March 2023')}
  updatedDate={new Date('1 March 2026')}
>
  <Container>
    <PageHeader
      title="About"
      breadcrumbs={[
        { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
        { label: 'About' },
      ]}
     
    />

    <ProfileSection
      imageSrc={portrait}
      imageAlt="Chris Lloyd-Jones"
      showBadges={true}
      showFormerRoles={true}
    >
      <div slot="bio">
        <p>
          I'm an {profileRole} based in the Seattle area. I started writing IRC bots at nine. I went into law before returning to engineering, and my legal training still shapes what I ask when an AI agent can act on someone's behalf. Who gave it permission, what can it do, and who's accountable for the result?
        </p>
        <p>
          At Kyndryl, I created the Forward Deployed Engineering capability with a three-year target of 22,000 engineers. Engineers worked alongside clients and remained responsible for the software they built together. At Avanade, I founded Platforms &amp; Incubation and hired the product team for Avanade.ai.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm a seven-time Microsoft MVP in AI and Developer Technologies, a member of the Institution of Engineering and Technology (MIET), and the <a href="https://globalai.community/chapters/seattle/">Seattle Chapter Lead for Global AI Community</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm a doctoral candidate at the University of East London, where I research Green AI and Green Software Engineering. I previously served as Steering Committee Vice-Chair of the Green Software Foundation and contributed to <a href="https://www.iso.org/standard/86612.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ISO/IEC 21031:2024</a>, the international standard for Software Carbon Intensity. You can find my research profile on <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7995-7865" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ORCID</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I co-host <a href="https://securing.quest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Securing the Realm</a> with Josh McDonald, where we talk about AI governance and AI-driven development. If you're considering me for a talk or panel, my <a href="/speaking/kit" class="plausible-event-name=Speaker+Kit+Click plausible-event-source=about">speaker kit</a> has topics, bios and booking details.
        </p>
      </div>
    </ProfileSection>
  </Container>
</Layout>
